#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:5
#: b1a3cff3c67a446d9bd138446e2a3511
msgid "QuadPlane Parameter setup"
msgstr "四旋翼飞机参数设置"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:7
#: 67940916f9cf466daaa673c1525fc559
msgid ""
"All QuadPlane specific parameters start with a \"Q\\_\" prefix. The "
"parameters are very similar to the equivalent Copter parameters so if you "
"are familiar with those you should find setting up a QuadPlane is easy."
msgstr ""
"所有四旋翼飞机专用参数均以 「Q\\_」 前缀开头。这些参数与等效的 ArduCopter "
"参数非常相似，因此如果您熟悉那些参数，您会发现设置四旋翼飞机非常容易。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:13
#: ee07230ca1fe4ac6a4a9c9deed7ffdfd
msgid "Key Parameters"
msgstr "关键参数"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:15
#: cef950276ef64f9bb65fdf00de94183d
msgid ""
"To enable QuadPlane functionality you need to set the "
":ref:`Q_ENABLE<Q_ENABLE>` parameter to 1 and then refresh the parameter list"
msgstr "要启用四旋翼飞机功能，您需要将 :ref:`Q_ENABLE<Q_ENABLE>` 参数设置为 1，然后刷新参数列表"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:17
#: a27ccde67dbd4dfa82af05266cc3817d
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN<Q_M_PWM_MIN>` and :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX<Q_M_PWM_MAX>` "
"parameters used to set the PWM range of the VTOL motors (MOTORx) and the "
"SERVOx_MIN/MAX for the outputs driving these motors is ignored. These need "
"to be set to the range your ESCs expect."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN<Q_M_PWM_MIN>` 和 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX<Q_M_PWM_MAX>` 参数用于设置 "
"VTOL 电机（MOTORx）的 PWM 范围，驱动这些电机的输出的 SERVOx_MIN/MAX 将被忽略。这些参数需要设置为您的 ESC "
"所期望的范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:20
#: 3fe0376a073741e3b32a33e4fec75ae0
msgid ""
"The most critical tuning parameters are :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_P<Q_A_RAT_RLL_P>` "
"and :ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P<Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>`. These default to 0.25 but you may "
"find significantly higher values are needed for a QuadPlane."
msgstr ""
"最关键的调参参数是 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_P<Q_A_RAT_RLL_P>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_P<Q_A_RAT_PIT_P>`。这些参数默认为 0.25，但您可能会发现四旋翼飞机需要显著更高的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:23
#: 98b3ec9a63594ca1a41d5be66e96f1de
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM<Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` parameter is important for getting the"
" right level of motor output when armed in a quad mode"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM<Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` 参数对于在四旋翼模式下解锁时获得正确的电机输出水平非常重要"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:25
#: cbed586a52f9455b9e514b59b24739f5
msgid ""
"It is recommended that you set :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` to 2 to "
"allow for rudder disarm. Alternatively you could have :ref:`MANUAL <manual-"
"mode>` as one of your available flight modes (as that will shut down the "
"quad motors). Please be careful not to use hard left rudder and zero "
"throttle while flying or you risk disarming your motors."
msgstr ""
"建议将 :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` 设置为 2，以允许通过方向舵上锁。或者，您可以将 "
":ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>` "
"作为可用飞行模式之一（因为这将关闭四旋翼电机）。请注意，在飞行过程中不要使用全左方向舵和零油门，否则有上锁电机的风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:30
#: f0b3f261af7f424ab20f7de1798082cb
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The default :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` for a QuadPlane is to "
"300 (Hz). Most QuadPlanes do not need this to be raised. Some very small "
"vehicles (< 1Kg) might benefit from setting it to 400. In heavier vehicles, "
"their higher inertia results in lower effective control response rates, so "
"they do not benefit from a higher loop rate. Raising above 300 only leads to"
" larger log files in these vehicles."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼飞机的默认 :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` 为 "
"300（Hz）。大多数四旋翼飞机无需提高此值。一些非常小的飞行器（< 1Kg）可能受益于将其设置为 "
"400。对于较重的飞行器，其较高的惯性导致有效控制响应速率降低，因此它们不会从更高的循环速率中受益。在这些飞行器中，提高到 300 "
"以上只会产生更大的日志文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:33
#: 5f390b72966b41ed9336bb8166e20955
msgid "Attitude Limiting Parameters"
msgstr "姿态限制参数"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:35
#: 3369db2141a44472910e234fca7c7ad7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The pitch and roll limits in VTOL modes are controlled by the lesser of "
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`, or the fixed wing limits "
"(:ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`, "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`, and :ref:` "
"ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`), but conformance to only "
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>` can be controlled with "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 14."
msgstr ""
"VTOL 模式下的俯仰和横滚限制由 :ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX<Q_ANGLE_MAX>` "
"与固定翼限制（:ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`、:ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`"
" 和 :ref:` ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>`）中的较小值控制，但可以通过 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 的第 14 位来控制仅遵从 :ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX<Q_ANGLE_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:37
#: 30deb3940d3d4a21a908ecd302e7bc6d
msgid ""
"In addition, :ref:`Q_BCK_PIT_LIM<Q_BCK_PIT_LIM>` sets the maximum number of "
"degrees of back or pitch up in Q modes when the airspeed is at "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`, and is used to prevent excessive "
"structural loads when pitching up to decelerate. The backwards/up pitch "
"limit controlled by this parameter is in addition to limiting applied by the"
" params above. The :ref:`Q_BCK_PIT_LIM<Q_BCK_PIT_LIM>` limit is only applied"
" when :ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>` is set to 1 or 2 and the vehicle "
"is flying in a mode that uses forward throttle instead of forward tilt to "
"generate forward speed. A value 0 to deactivates this limit."
msgstr ""
"此外，:ref:`Q_BCK_PIT_LIM<Q_BCK_PIT_LIM>` 设置了在 Q 模式下当空速处于 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` "
"时，最大后仰或上仰角度，用于防止在上仰减速时产生过大的结构载荷。由该参数控制的后退/上仰俯仰限制是在上述参数限制基础上额外施加的。:ref:`Q_BCK_PIT_LIM<Q_BCK_PIT_LIM>`"
" 限制仅在 :ref:`Q_FWD_THR_USE<Q_FWD_THR_USE>` 设置为 1 或 2 "
"且飞行器在使用前向油门而非前倾来产生前向速度的模式下飞行时才会应用。值为 0 时停用此限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:42
#: 8bb37abb7e074b719c52483abdb0e2e1
msgid "Return Behavior Setup Guide:"
msgstr "返航行为设置指南："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:44
#: de3d485a9d56482dbf6f8f1a3a0a76ed
msgid ""
"While there are many parameters setting distances and heights for the "
"various home return modes/behaviors (read about failsafes in "
":ref:`quadplane-flying` and :ref:`QRTL and RTL modes <quadplane-flight-"
"modes>`), this is a quick setup guide for basic behaviors."
msgstr ""
"虽然各种返家模式/行为有许多设置距离和高度的参数（请阅读 :ref:`quadplane-flying` 和 :ref:`QRTL and RTL "
"modes <quadplane-flight-modes>` 中关于失控保护的内容），但这是一个基本行为的快速设置指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:47
#: 6ea92bc08d834394a47cbda7c9f8f881
msgid "RTL mode"
msgstr "RTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:49
#: 10dd315f271945c58ee352043c566a64
msgid ""
"Is a fixed wing return mode which normally flys back to the home point and "
"loiters, but can optionally do an automatic mission sequence, usually set by"
" the user to land the vehicle at home in fixed wing mode."
msgstr "是一种固定翼返航模式，通常飞回 Home 点并盘旋，但也可以选择执行自动任务序列，通常由用户设置为在固定翼模式下在 Home 点降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:51
#: 95cd9d78aaef45b0bfbe5cd9c955f1dc
msgid ""
"If entered from VTOL flight several other behavior options can be selected "
"by the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` parameter."
msgstr "如果从 VTOL 飞行进入，可以通过 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 参数选择其他几种行为选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:54
#: 7f63dc7dd54649cd8e9ba421a0c72495
msgid "QRTL mode"
msgstr "QRTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:56
#: fb8f094a4f6f4e408cecf6aa63c0169b
msgid ""
"When operating close to home is a VTOL return and the land at home, but "
"further away will switch to fixed wing flight until back closer to home, and"
" then transition back to VTOL and land at home. QRTL mode always results in "
"a VTOL landing at home unless the pilot interrupts it."
msgstr ""
"当在 Home 附近操作时，会进行 VTOL 返航并在 Home 降落，但距离较远时会切换到固定翼飞行，直到接近 Home，然后切换回 VTOL 并在 "
"Home 降落。QRTL 模式始终以在 Home 进行 VTOL 降落结束，除非飞手中断它。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:59
#: 7055f116e71248bdbacafbb2765d17c0
msgid "RC Failsafe"
msgstr "遥控失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:61
#: dfe10b82eb13422aa96ada995250d1d7
msgid ""
"Loss of RC link can switch to a return flight mode or several other "
"behaviors."
msgstr "遥控链路丢失可以切换到返航飞行模式或其他几种行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:64
#: e88d03b86922435084e5748a0ff0f20e
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:66
#: 96d75e1bf77a4cb0b0885aad28f3a624
msgid ""
"1.If you lose RC link for greater than "
":ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` in fixed wing flight set "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` value below to obtain various behavior "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"1. 如果在固定翼飞行中遥控链路丢失时间超过 :ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>`，请将 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` 值设置如下以获取各种行为选项："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:68
#: 60b2bfb48abe47e0a75e246612a18e40
msgid ""
"\"0\" : do nothing if in AUTO mode, otherwise switch to RTL mode (see #3,4 "
"below)"
msgstr "「0」：如果处于 Auto 模式则不执行任何操作，否则切换到 RTL 模式（参见下方第 3、4 条）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:69
#: ab16b70aad86433db3ed6dc33f4bbeb6
msgid "\"1\" : switch to RTL mode (see #3,4 below)"
msgstr "「1」：切换到 RTL 模式（参见下方第 3、4 条）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:70
#: de79a6f768a64905983ffd5e3900ba08
msgid "\"2\" : cut throttle and glide in FWBA mode"
msgstr "「2」：关闭油门并在 FWBA 模式下滑翔"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:71
#: aa2d62eff43e4e2881a5b238eda3f613
msgid "\"3\" : deploy parachute (assuming you have one setup)"
msgstr "「3」：部署降落伞（假设您已设置一个）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:72
#: 5e4f7ef59068461da033e880af323995
msgid ""
"\"4\" : switch to AUTO mode and execute mission at current mission sequence "
"pointer"
msgstr "「4」：切换到 Auto 模式并从当前任务序列指针处执行任务"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:74
#: 03afd08268c9465785240878b78c92f6
msgid ""
"If you lose RC link for greater than :ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>`"
" in VTOL flight, you will immediately QLAND, unless you select the following"
" optional behavior:"
msgstr ""
"如果在 VTOL 飞行中遥控链路丢失时间超过 :ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>`，您将立即执行 "
"QLAND，除非您选择以下可选行为："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:76
#: 84b3792b61a74971a4a1b37901fb6996
msgid ""
"set :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 5 to switch to QRTL mode instead. (see "
"#5 below)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 5 位以切换到 QRTL 模式。（参见下方第 5 条）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:77
#: 6539527a3f014b3e8ed7648fa9c1cf30
msgid ""
"set :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 20 to switch to RTL mode instead (see "
"#3,4 below). If bit 5 is set above, it will be ignored in lieu of this "
"option bit."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 20 位以切换到 RTL 模式（参见下方第 3、4 条）。如果上面设置了第 5 "
"位，它将被忽略，以此选项位为准。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:79
#: d154056d436d4113bfdceb83778685bb
msgid ""
"Anytime you switch to RTL (due either to manual mode change or failsafe "
"action), do you want to execute an autoland sequence (does not need to "
"actually have a land command, if some other action is desired), rather than "
"just return and loiter around home?"
msgstr ""
"任何时候切换到 "
"RTL（无论是手动模式更改还是失控保护动作），您是否希望执行自动降落序列（不需要实际包含降落指令，如果需要其他动作的话），而不是仅返回并在 Home "
"盘旋？"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:81
#: 97bdfcfd99b9415db91ae4d00525b308
msgid ""
"If yes,then set up a DO_LAND_START mission sequence and enable the "
":ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` parameter. See :ref:`common-do-land-start`"
" for details of setup."
msgstr ""
"如果是，则设置 DO_LAND_START 任务序列并启用 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 参数。详见 "
":ref:`common-do-land-start` 的设置详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:83
#: 2b3219886dec4075a8d824e98863dcfc
msgid ""
"If in a VTOL mode, and you switch to RTL (due either to manual mode change "
"or failsafe action), then set the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` parameter "
"value as follows to determine the behavior:"
msgstr ""
"如果处于 VTOL 模式，并切换到 RTL（无论是手动模式更改还是失控保护动作），则按如下设置 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 参数值以确定行为："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:85
#: e95b944e206748a68b6eb3313e59d83e
msgid ""
"\"0\" : Switch to normal RTL mode, transitioning to fixed wing (see #3 "
"above)"
msgstr "「0」：切换到正常 RTL 模式，过渡到固定翼（参见上方第 3 条）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:86
#: 4e5a3b3d1a694a93a40042c214a01465
msgid ""
"\"1\" : Transition to fixed wing, fly towards home, transition back to VTOL "
"mode when close to home, move to over home, switch to QLAND and land at home"
" in VTOL."
msgstr ""
"「1」：过渡到固定翼，飞向 Home，接近 Home 时切换回 VTOL 模式，移动到 Home 上方，切换到 QLAND 并以 VTOL 方式在 "
"Home 降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:87
#: 272e8cb300e14b869b2fa428920015f3
msgid ""
"\"2\" : Transition to fixed wing, fly towards home, loiter down to altitude "
"around home, turn into the wind, transition back to VTOL mode and move to "
"over home, switch to QLAND and land at home in VTOL"
msgstr ""
"「2」：过渡到固定翼，飞向 Home，在 Home 附近盘旋下降到高度，转向迎风，切换回 VTOL 模式并移动到 Home 上方，切换到 QLAND "
"并以 VTOL 方式在 Home 降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:88
#: 170778ea80fe4560842ec7c27b930c85
msgid ""
"\"3\" : Switch to QRTL :Transition to fixed wing, and do a special approach "
"to home including \"airbraking\",  transition back to VTOL mode, move to "
"over home, switch to QLAND and land at home in VTOL."
msgstr ""
"「3」：切换到 QRTL：过渡到固定翼，对 Home 进行特殊进近（包括「空气制动」），切换回 VTOL 模式，移动到 Home 上方，切换到 "
"QLAND 并以 VTOL 方式在 Home 降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:90
#: 9cb88385cd3449bc86077b742bda62dd
msgid ""
"When switching to QRTL  default behavior is to transition to fixed wing if "
"in VTOL (assuming you are not close to home already in VTOL Flight), flying "
"back to home, then switching back to VTOL as you approach home, switching to"
" QLAND over home, and landing at home (see :ref:`qrtl-mode` for more "
"information). You can disable the fixed wing approach, and return home and "
"land only using VTOL mode if :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16 set."
msgstr ""
"切换到 QRTL 时，默认行为是在 VTOL 飞行中过渡到固定翼（假设您在 VTOL 飞行中尚未接近 Home），飞回 Home，然后在接近 Home "
"时切换回 VTOL，在 Home 上方切换到 QLAND，并在 Home 降落（详见 :ref:`qrtl-mode`）。如果设置了 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 16 位，您可以禁用固定翼进近，仅使用 VTOL 模式返回 Home 并降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:94
#: 986faff8c79d4ce9a741ca08a760d7ab
msgid "Q_OPTIONS"
msgstr "Q_OPTIONS"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:95
#: 26ecc622052742b9955b06342c0c7bd3
msgid ""
"In addition, the behavior of QuadPlane can be modified by the setting of the"
" :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bitmask parameter (no bits are set, by "
"default):"
msgstr "此外，四旋翼飞机的行为可以通过设置 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位掩码参数进行修改（默认情况下没有位被设置）："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:97
#: 860ca0274b744a519c1c37ab0e469d46
msgid ""
"bit 0 (+1), if set, will force the transition from VTOL to Plane mode to "
"keep the wings level and not begin climbing with the VTOL motors (as in a "
"mission to a higher waypoint after VTOL takeoff) during the transition."
msgstr ""
"第 0 位（+1），如果设置，将强制从 VTOL 到固定翼模式的过渡保持机翼水平，并且在过渡期间不会使用 VTOL 电机爬升（例如在 VTOL "
"起飞后飞往更高航点的任务中）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:98
#: 5c927690ebad4dea930281152e6bab9d
msgid ""
"bit 1 (+2), if set, will use a fixed wing takeoff instead of a VTOL takeoff "
"for ground stations that can only send TAKEOFF instead of a separate "
"VTOL_TAKEOFF mission command. Otherwise, QuadPlane will use VTOL takeoffs "
"for a TAKEOFF mission command."
msgstr ""
"第 1 位（+2），如果设置，将对只能发送 TAKEOFF 而非单独 VTOL_TAKEOFF 任务命令的地面站使用固定翼起飞代替 VTOL "
"起飞。否则，四旋翼飞机将对 TAKEOFF 任务命令使用 VTOL 起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:99
#: 6518ade1d33a48c8a116c84d6d7f288a
msgid ""
"bit 2 (+4), if set, will use a fixed wing landing instead of a VTOL landing "
"for ground stations that can only send LAND instead of a separate VTOL_LAND "
"mission command. Otherwise, QuadPlane will use VTOL_LAND for a LAND mission "
"command."
msgstr ""
"第 2 位（+4），如果设置，将对只能发送 LAND 而非单独 VTOL_LAND 任务命令的地面站使用固定翼降落代替 VTOL "
"降落。否则，四旋翼飞机将对 LAND 任务命令使用 VTOL_LAND。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:100
#: 68b34f80a5ef4e20b5cb42a9247c6b38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"bit 3 (+8), if set, will interpret the takeoff altitude of a mission "
"VTOL_TAKEOFF as specified when setup in Mission Planner (ie Relative to "
"Home/Absolute {ASL}/Terrain {AGL}). Otherwise, it is relative to the takeoff"
" point's altitude (AGL)."
msgstr ""
"第 3 位（+8），如果设置，将按照在 Mission Planner 中设置时指定的方式解释任务 VTOL_TAKEOFF 的起飞高度（即相对于 "
"Home/绝对值{ASL}/地形{AGL}）。否则，它相对于起飞点高度（AGL）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:101
#: 8b6db803a6fd42189b0d7079a3fe20e7
msgid ""
"bit 4(+16), if set, for “Always use FW spiral approach”  then during a "
"VTOL_LAND mission command,instead of transitioning to VTOL flight and doing "
"a VTOL landing, it will remain in plane mode, and proceed to the landing "
"position, climbing or descending to the altitude set in the VTOL_LAND "
"waypoint. When it reaches within :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` "
"of the landing location, it will perform a LOITER_TO_ALT to finish the climb"
" or descent to that altitude set in the waypoint, then, turning into the "
"wind, transition to VTOL mode and proceed to the landing location and land. "
"Otherwise, a standard VTOL_LAND will be executed. See :ref:`quadplane-auto-"
"mode` for more information."
msgstr ""
"第 4 位（+16），如果设置，则「始终使用固定翼螺旋进近」，在执行 VTOL_LAND 任务命令时，不会过渡到 VTOL 飞行并进行 VTOL "
"降落，而是保持固定翼模式，飞向降落位置，爬升或下降到 VTOL_LAND 航点中设置的高度。当它到达距降落位置 "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 以内时，将执行 LOITER_TO_ALT "
"完成爬升或下降至航点中设置的高度，然后转向迎风，过渡到 VTOL 模式，飞向降落位置并降落。否则，将执行标准 VTOL_LAND。详见 "
":ref:`quadplane-auto-mode`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:102
#: 435c67a400964f1f9fc9037d39f2323d
msgid ""
"bit 5(+32), if set,  it will replace QLAND with QRTL for failsafe actions "
"when in VTOL modes. See the Radio and Throttle Failsafe section of "
":ref:`quadplane-flying` for more information."
msgstr ""
"第 5 位（+32），如果设置，在 VTOL 模式中发生失控保护时，将用 QRTL 替代 QLAND。详见 :ref:`quadplane-"
"flying` 的遥控和油门失控保护部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:103
#: 85b94bbcf54443efb5c84a6d7f19d99d
msgid ""
"bit 6(+64), if set, will enforce the ICE idle governor even in MANUAL mode."
msgstr "第 6 位（+64），如果设置，即使在 Manual 模式下也会强制执行 ICE 怠速调速器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:104
#: 2c780b37984043838f9fa82a3df2c67d
msgid ""
"bit 7(+128), if set, will force QASSIST to be active at all times in VTOL "
"modes. See :ref:`Assisted Fixed-Wing Flight<assisted_fixed_wing_flight>`."
msgstr ""
"第 7 位（+128），如果设置，将强制 QASSIST 在 VTOL 模式下始终处于激活状态。详见 :ref:`Assisted Fixed-Wing"
" Flight<assisted_fixed_wing_flight>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:105
#: 69b8f106079a496c8cb18ddb87770c4b
msgid ""
"bit 8(+256), if set, QASSIST will only affect VTOL motors. If not set, "
"QAssist will also use flying surfaces to stabilize(:ref:`Assisted Fixed-Wing"
" Flight<assisted_fixed_wing_flight>` )."
msgstr ""
"第 8 位（+256），如果设置，QASSIST 将只影响 VTOL 电机。如果未设置，QAssist "
"也将使用飞行面来稳定（:ref:`Assisted Fixed-Wing Flight<assisted_fixed_wing_flight>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:106
#: 183fb5c2b6504085a1fc967e7764ce24
msgid ""
"bit 9(+512), if set, will enable AirMode (:ref:`airmode`) if armed via an RC"
" switch. See :ref:`Auxiliary Functions<common-auxiliary-functions>` option "
"value 41. This function has been deprecated as of Version 4.2. See new "
"arming switch options in :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`"
msgstr ""
"第 9 位（+512），如果设置，将在通过遥控开关解锁时启用 AirMode（:ref:`airmode`）。详见 :ref:`Auxiliary "
"Functions<common-auxiliary-functions>` 选项值 41。此功能自 4.2 版本起已弃用。请参阅 "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` 中新的解锁开关选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:107
#: b4c17e9e72df4d8081095e88eff92551
msgid ""
"bit 10(+1024), if set, will allow the tilt servos to move with rudder input "
"in vectored tilt setups while disarmed to determine range of motion."
msgstr "第 10 位（+1024），如果设置，将允许在上锁状态下通过方向舵输入移动倾转舵机（在矢量倾转设置中），以确定运动范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:108
#: 7a17ac3645d34d39abbe7185a5670542
msgid ""
"bit 11(+2048), if set, will delay VTOL motor spin up until 2 seconds after "
"arming."
msgstr "第 11 位（+2048），如果设置，将延迟 VTOL 电机旋转启动，直到解锁后 2 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:109
#: 15b0a1b661e44740a3fbd005600294e4
msgid ""
"bit 12(+4096), if set, disable speed based Qassist when using synthetic "
"airspeed"
msgstr "第 12 位（+4096），如果设置，将在使用合成空速时禁用基于速度的 Qassist"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:110
#: 093c17e8e68a4bce8e498c90b5da6e17
msgid ""
"bit 13(+8192), if set, will disable Ground Effect Compensation of baro due "
"to ground effect pressures"
msgstr "第 13 位（+8192），如果设置，将禁用由于地面效应气压对气压计的地面效应补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:111
#: aef17d30742947fa918f688675003191
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"bit 14(+16384), if set, ignore forward flight angle limits in Qmodes, "
"otherwise :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`, "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`, and "
":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` can constrain "
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>` in VTOL modes."
msgstr ""
"第 14 位（+16384），如果设置，将忽略 Q 模式中的前飞角度限制，否则 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`、:ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`"
" 和 :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` 可能会在 VTOL 模式下约束 "
":ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX<Q_ANGLE_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:112
#: 807b85d9840b475cbc9f189e7c827393
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"bit 15(+32768), if set, will allow pilot to control descent during VTOL "
"AUTO-LAND phases, similar to throttle stick action during QHOVER or QLOITER."
" However, this will not become active until the throttle stick is raised "
"above 70% during the descent at least once."
msgstr ""
"第 15 位（+32768），如果设置，将允许飞手在 VTOL 自动降落阶段控制下降，类似于在 QHOVER 或 QLOITER "
"期间的油门杆操作。但是，这不会激活，直到下降过程中油门杆至少一次被推过 70%。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:113
#: c0e63f52feea40598674b06c3f050a24
msgid ""
"bit 16(+65536), if set, will disable the fixed wing approach in QRTL mode "
"and VTOL_LANDING mission items, see Hybrid RTL modes section of "
":ref:`quadplane-flying` for details of this hybrid landing approach."
msgstr ""
"第 16 位（+65536），如果设置，将在 QRTL 模式和 VTOL_LANDING 任务项中禁用固定翼进近，详见 :ref:`quadplane-"
"flying` 的混合 RTL 模式部分，了解此混合降落进近的详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:114
#: 794d301294a841ae9e794d95e87bbade
msgid ""
"bit 17(+131072), if set, will enable pilot horizontal re-positioning during "
"VTOL auto LAND phases, momentarily pausing the descent while doing so."
msgstr "第 17 位（+131072），如果设置，将在 VTOL 自动降落阶段允许飞手水平重新定位，同时暂时暂停下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:115
#: b3d10521de7047bd8b172ad3d64b62a6
msgid ""
"bit 18(+262144), if set, will only allow arming in VTOL and AUTO modes. This"
" can be used for tailsitters to prevent arming in a fixed wing mode when "
"sitting in VTOL stance to prevent tip-overs. For AUTO mode, WP must be a "
"VTOL takeoff in order to arm with this option."
msgstr ""
"第 18 位（+262144），如果设置，将只允许在 VTOL 和 Auto 模式下解锁。这可用于尾坐式飞机，防止在 VTOL "
"姿态下以固定翼模式解锁以防止翻倒。对于 Auto 模式，航点必须是 VTOL 起飞才能使用此选项解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:116
#: 4472e92c1f664474938a7fe7ed93db25
msgid ""
"bit 19(+524288), if set, will allow the forcing of VTOL to Fixed Wing "
"transitions if :ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL<Q_TRANS_FAIL>` is not zero and exceeded, "
"and if the airspeed is greater than 1/2 of "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`, then the transition to fixed wing will "
"immediately complete, rather than taking the "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT<Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT>` action. See :ref:`quadplane-"
"transitions`."
msgstr ""
"第 19 位（+524288），如果设置，当 :ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL<Q_TRANS_FAIL>` 不为零且超时时，将允许强制从 VTOL"
" 过渡到固定翼，如果空速大于 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 的 1/2，则过渡到固定翼将立即完成，而不是执行 "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT<Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT>` 动作。详见 :ref:`quadplane-"
"transitions`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:117
#: c14b09fb16374dc6b32c99d418ccb569
msgid ""
"bit 20(+1048576), if set overrides bit 5, if set, and forces an RTL on RC "
"failsafe while in a VTOL mode. This is useful in over-water operations where"
" either an QLAND or QRTL is undesirable."
msgstr ""
"第 20 位（+1048576），如果设置，将覆盖第 5 位（如果已设置），并在 VTOL 模式下发生遥控失控保护时强制执行 "
"RTL。这在水上操作时很有用，因为 QLAND 或 QRTL 都不理想。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:118
#: a033a143be1047539cb343d646bc7e45
msgid ""
"bit 21(+2097152), if set tilts tilt motors up when disarmed in FW modes "
"(except manual) to prevent ground strikes."
msgstr "第 21 位（+2097152），如果设置，在固定翼模式（Manual 除外）上锁时将倾转电机向上倾斜，以防止地面碰撞。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:119
#: 8199e05720b04d4192ce20ea6346aec2
msgid ""
"bit 22(+4194304), if set scale fixed wing FF pid gains by the ratio of "
"VTOL/fixed wing angle P gains in VTOL modes rather than reducing VTOL angle "
"P based on airspeed. Used only if experiencing oscillations in back "
"transitions at high airspeeds."
msgstr ""
"第 22 位（+4194304），如果设置，在 VTOL 模式下按 VTOL/固定翼角度 P 增益之比缩放固定翼 FF PID 增益，而不是根据空速降低"
" VTOL 角度 P。仅在高空速后过渡时出现振荡时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:121
#: dd236b48a83346d3889b0e9e61448f77
msgid ""
"Behavior can be modified as well as by the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` and"
" :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE<Q_GUIDED_MODE>` parameters."
msgstr ""
"行为也可以通过 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 和 :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE<Q_GUIDED_MODE>` "
"参数进行修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:123
#: fccc06f23a93495c9522e038532d7677
msgid ""
"If you set :ref:`INITIAL_MODE<INITIAL_MODE>` to a VTOL mode, then switch to "
"a fixed wing (other than MANUAL/ACRO/TRAINING) before arming, you will "
"effectively be in a VTOL transition and when armed, the motors will spin up,"
" and move, if tilted, to vertical."
msgstr ""
"如果您将 :ref:`INITIAL_MODE<INITIAL_MODE>` 设置为 VTOL "
"模式，然后在解锁前切换到固定翼模式（Manual/Acro/Training 除外），您实际上将处于 VTOL "
"过渡状态，解锁后电机将旋转启动，并在倾转时移动到垂直位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-parameters.rst:127
#: 63162bf1608b457cbb01cf2bd563e497
msgid ""
"The QuadPlane code requires GPS lock for proper operation. This is inherited"
" from the plane code, which disables inertial estimation of attitude and "
"position if GPS lock is not available. Do not try to fly a QuadPlane "
"indoors. It will not fly well!!!!"
msgstr ""
"四旋翼飞机代码需要 GPS 锁定才能正常运行。这继承自固定翼代码，如果没有 GPS "
"锁定，它将禁用姿态和位置的惯性估算。不要尝试在室内飞行四旋翼飞机。它将无法正常飞行！！！！"
